-- A helper returning a pair whose first field is the point 1.0 (a shifted
-- zero factor) beside a fresh Normal: neither field reads the argument, so
-- the call carries the pair's field laws (JReturns) and `fst` of it is the
-- point (task dirac-law-point-lost-under-plus-or-helper).
p(1.0)=(1.0, 0.0)
p(0.0) is impossible
